# Design Controls -- Read Before Acting (REDIRECT)

This rule has been replaced. The local `design-controls/` directory
no longer exists; the Atlas MCP server is the single source of truth
for User Needs, Design Inputs, Design Outputs, Verification Tests,
Validation Tests, Risks, and the Software Architecture Document.

Use:

- `atlas-design-controls-first.mdc` -- read this before acting.
- `atlas-vt-enforcement.mdc` -- the full UN / DI / DO / Risk / VT /
  VAL workflow against Atlas.
- `atlas-design-controls-validation.mdc` -- pre-flight and post-call
